---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="TrophyLog — Your Hunt. Remembered.">

	<!-- Navigation -->
	<nav class="q-nav" id="q-nav">
		<div class="q-nav-inner">
			<a href="/" class="q-brand">
				<svg viewBox="0 0 946.59 766.6" aria-hidden="true">
					<path fill="currentColor" d="M453.32,764.64c6.73,4.91,11.91.57,14.73-12.48,13.21-61.18,29.36-123.62,66.26-175.72,75.87-112.41,201.49-168.53,281.23-278.61,46.15-62.56,91.35-138.15,113.93-212,8.7-28.45,24.38-82.19,13.3-85.59-1.69-.52-4.24-.55-7.77,4.03-8.8,11.39-18.34,33.8-26.69,48.64-57.07,101.43-178.18,300.16-265.64,317.04-41.8,8.07-37.77-63.87-32.96-102.83,3.59-29.11,14.01-52.69,23.38-79.29,7.03-19.95,11.46-42.47,4.29-42.93-16.65-1.08-65.91,79.85-80.67,115.78-28.44,69.22-29.22,133.8-68.62,195.33-20.03,31.29-35.61-1.54-32.56-59.81,1.93-36.91,12.14-68.44,18.52-102.35,1.25-6.64,1.58-12.94.4-14.99-3.86-6.71-17.76,17.02-20.65,22.74-35.16,69.62-68.06,177.21-63.92,267.93,2.89,63.23,12.98,150.22,61.67,193.7.36.32,1.26,1.05,1.77,1.42Z"/>
					<path fill="currentColor" d="M300.55,512.24c-8.43-38.35-19.07-77.21-41.97-110.06-48.63-69.79-126.77-105.24-177.05-174.1C52.44,188.94,25.98,140.97,11.64,94.7,6.12,76.87-2.63,45.38.76,42.37c1.28-1.14,3.67-.27,5.17,1.84,5.23,7.36,11.61,21.14,16.85,30.45,36.24,63.37,112.79,186.27,167.35,198.24,26.37,4.2,23.2-40.11,20.44-64.58-2.58-18.22-9-32.98-14.85-49.68-4.52-12.48-8.16-27.72-2.79-26.92,11.66,1.74,41.52,49.93,50.87,72.43,18,43.35,20.03,82.99,43.49,122.36,13.33,19.12,22.78-1.08,20.28-37.59-1.01-23.16-7.78-42.9-11.85-64.15-.8-4.16-1.03-7.12-.25-8.13,2.85-3.69,11.05,9.4,12.97,12.94,21.11,44.13,43.4,111.01,40.72,167.91-2.07,43.79-7.84,95.67-38.66,122.2-.16.14-.5.41-.67.54-4,3.36-7.48.18-9.28-8.01Z"/>
				</svg>
				TrophyLog
			</a>
			<div class="q-nav-links">
				<a href="#chapters">Chapters</a>
				<a href="#medal">Medal</a>
				<a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
				<a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
			</div>
			<a href="#signup" class="q-nav-cta">Join the Beta</a>
		</div>
	</nav>

	<!-- Hero -->
	<header class="q-hero">
		<div class="q-hero-bg"><img src="/hero-deer.jpg" alt="" loading="eager" /></div>
		<div class="q-hero-overlay"></div>
		<div class="q-hero-meta">
			<div>
				<span>Vol. 01</span>
				<span>Issue 03</span>
				<span>Spring 2026</span>
			</div>
			<div>
				<span>55.67° N</span>
				<span>12.57° E</span>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="q-hero-content reveal">
			<div class="q-hero-num">— Chapter One</div>
			<h1>Your hunt.<br /><em>Remembered.</em></h1>
			<div class="q-hero-sub">A logbook for hunters who know a season is made of moments — and moments demand to be kept.</div>
			<div class="q-ctas">
				<a href="#signup" class="q-btn q-btn-primary">
					Join the Beta
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
				</a>
				<a href="#chapters" class="q-btn q-btn-ghost">Read the field report</a>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="q-hero-scroll">Scroll</div>
	</header>

	<!-- Chapter 1 -->
	<section class="q-section" id="chapters">
		<div class="q-inner">
			<div class="q-chapter reveal">
				<div class="q-chapter-num">I.<small>The Grounds</small></div>
				<h2>Before you sit,<br /><em>you map</em>.</h2>
			</div>

			<div class="q-story-grid reveal">
				<div class="q-story-copy">
					<p class="lead">Every serious hunter keeps their ground in their head — the stands, the trails, the plot the deer cross at dusk.</p>
					<p>TrophyLog draws it for you. Satellite imagery. Polygon boundaries. Parking, high seats, trail cameras, food plots, forbidden zones. Share with your group; or keep it private.</p>
					<p>What lives in your head, now lives in your pocket. Offline-ready for the places the signal never finds.</p>
					<a href="#pricing" class="read-more">Continue →</a>
				</div>
				<div class="q-story-visual">
					<div class="phone phone-lg">
						<div class="phone-screen"><img src="/screenshots/screen-map.jpg" alt="Satellite map of a hunting ground with markers" loading="lazy" /></div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Chapter 2 -->
	<section class="q-section">
		<div class="q-inner">
			<div class="q-chapter reveal">
				<div class="q-chapter-num">II.<small>The Sit</small></div>
				<h2>The weather,<br />the wind, <em>the wait</em>.</h2>
			</div>

			<div class="q-story-grid reverse reveal">
				<div class="q-story-copy">
					<p class="lead">A hunt is weather, wind, light, patience — and one clean moment. TrophyLog captures all of it, so you don't have to.</p>
					<p>The app auto-fills conditions from your GPS. Sun and moon charted for the day. Ten-second entries at the tailgate; ten-page entries on the long drive home. Driven hunts hold ten shooters as easily as solo sits.</p>
					<p>Photos attach to hunts. Hunts attach to grounds. Everything connects.</p>
					<a href="#signup" class="read-more">Continue →</a>
				</div>
				<div class="q-story-visual">
					<div class="phone phone-lg">
						<div class="phone-screen"><img src="/screenshots/screen-hunt-detail.jpg" alt="Detailed hunt view with weather and notes" loading="lazy" /></div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Chapter 3 -->
	<section class="q-section">
		<div class="q-inner">
			<div class="q-chapter reveal">
				<div class="q-chapter-num">III.<small>The Trophy</small></div>
				<h2>What you carried out.<br /><em>And what you kept.</em></h2>
			</div>

			<div class="q-story-grid reveal">
				<div class="q-story-copy">
					<p class="lead">Not a notch on a rifle stock. A record: species, date, place, score, the weather that made it possible, the companions who shared it.</p>
					<p>CIC, B&amp;C, and SCI scoring built in. PDF export for the trophy room or the insurance file. Link a trophy back to the sit it came from, and the ground where it happened.</p>
					<p>The story is complete. And it stays yours.</p>
					<a href="#medal" class="read-more">And, if you want it, a physical form →</a>
				</div>
				<div class="q-story-visual">
					<div class="phone phone-lg">
						<div class="phone-screen"><img src="/screenshots/screen-trophies.jpg" alt="Trophy catalog with species and dates" loading="lazy" /></div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Medal -->
	<section class="q-medal-showcase" id="medal">
		<div class="q-medal-inner">
			<div class="reveal">
				<div class="q-chapter-num">IV.<small>The Medal</small></div>
				<h2 class="q-medal-h2">The brass <em>tells the story</em>.</h2>
				<p class="q-medal-lead">A walnut plaque. A brass-ringed QR tile. For any trophy in your log, a physical object that remembers.</p>
				<p class="q-medal-body">Hand-finished in Denmark. Engraved with species, date, and location. Two sizes, two woods. The QR stays with the mount — sell the rifle, sell the land; the medal and the memory belong to the hunt.</p>
				<p class="q-medal-body">Scan it. The whole hunt plays back.</p>
				<div class="q-medal-ctas">
					<span class="q-btn q-btn-disabled">Coming soon</span>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="q-story-visual reveal">
				<img src="/screenshots/qr-trophy.jpg" alt="Walnut trophy plaque with QR code" class="q-medal-photo" loading="lazy" />
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Pricing -->
	<section class="q-section q-pricing" id="pricing">
		<div class="q-inner">
			<div class="q-chapter reveal">
				<div class="q-chapter-num">V.<small>Pricing</small></div>
				<h2>Free to start.<br /><em>More when it counts.</em></h2>
			</div>

			<div class="q-price-grid reveal">
				<div class="q-price">
					<div class="q-price-name">Free</div>
					<div class="q-price-tag">One hunter · Free forever</div>
					<div class="q-price-amt">€0</div>
					<div class="q-price-annual">&nbsp;</div>
					<div class="q-price-desc">Everything you need to start logging — your hunts, your trophies, your home ground.</div>
					<ul class="q-price-list">
						<li>10 hunts, 20 trophies</li>
						<li>2 GB storage (100 files)</li>
						<li>2 regions, 10 areas each</li>
						<li>10 contacts, 2 companions per trip</li>
						<li>Weather &amp; scent cone</li>
						<li class="off">Watermark on shared pages</li>
					</ul>
					<a href="#signup" class="q-price-cta ghost">Get Started →</a>
				</div>

				<div class="q-price featured">
					<div class="q-price-name">Premium</div>
					<div class="q-price-tag">For the serious season</div>
					<div class="q-price-amt">€5<small> / mo</small></div>
					<div class="q-price-annual">or €55 / year</div>
					<div class="q-price-desc">Unlimited logging, room for a season of photos, and watermark-free sharing.</div>
					<ul class="q-price-list">
						<li>Unlimited hunts &amp; trophies</li>
						<li>10 GB storage (2,000 files)</li>
						<li>5 regions, 25 areas each</li>
						<li>100 contacts, 5 companions per trip</li>
						<li>Watermark-free sharing</li>
					</ul>
					<a href="#signup" class="q-price-cta primary">Start with Premium →</a>
				</div>

				<div class="q-price">
					<div class="q-price-name">Pro</div>
					<div class="q-price-tag">Everything unlimited</div>
					<div class="q-price-amt">€10<small> / mo</small></div>
					<div class="q-price-annual">or €110 / year</div>
					<div class="q-price-desc">No limits on grounds, contacts, or companions — and storage that grows with you.</div>
					<ul class="q-price-list">
						<li>Unlimited hunts &amp; trophies</li>
						<li>50 GB storage, expandable</li>
						<li>Unlimited regions &amp; areas</li>
						<li>Unlimited contacts &amp; companions</li>
						<li>Watermark-free sharing</li>
					</ul>
					<a href="#signup" class="q-price-cta ghost">Go Pro →</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- FAQ -->
	<section class="q-section" id="faq">
		<div class="q-inner">
			<div class="q-chapter reveal">
				<div class="q-chapter-num">VI.<small>Questions</small></div>
				<h2>Fine print,<br /><em>plain spoken.</em></h2>
			</div>

			<div class="q-faq reveal">
				<div class="q-faq-item">
					<button class="q-faq-q"><span><span class="num">01</span>Does TrophyLog share my locations?</span><span class="mark">+</span></button>
					<div class="q-faq-a">Never. Grounds, trophies, and hunts are private by default. Groups you create only see what you share with them. No data sales, no ads, no third-party trackers. EU-hosted, GDPR-compliant.</div>
				</div>
				<div class="q-faq-item">
					<button class="q-faq-q"><span><span class="num">02</span>Does it work offline?</span><span class="mark">+</span></button>
					<div class="q-faq-a">Yes. Log hunts with no signal — entries queue and sync when you're back in range. Full offline sync is included on every plan, free or paid.</div>
				</div>
				<div class="q-faq-item">
					<button class="q-faq-q"><span><span class="num">03</span>Can I import my old logs?</span><span class="mark">+</span></button>
					<div class="q-faq-a">CSV import for hunts and trophies is live in beta. Photo-to-entry import for hand-written journals ships this spring. You can always backdate entries to any date.</div>
				</div>
				<div class="q-faq-item">
					<button class="q-faq-q"><span><span class="num">04</span>When can I get a QR medal?</span><span class="mark">+</span></button>
					<div class="q-faq-a">The physical medals are coming soon. Hand-finished walnut and oak plaques with an engraved QR tile — we'll announce pricing and availability to the beta waitlist first.</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Signup -->
	<section class="q-signup" id="signup">
		<div class="q-signup-inner reveal">
			<div class="q-hero-num">— Final Chapter</div>
			<h2>Be ready <em>when the season opens.</em></h2>
			<p>The beta takes a few hundred new hunters each month. Drop your email — we'll send the link when your turn comes up.</p>
			<form id="signup-form" novalidate>
				<input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your name" autocomplete="name" required />
				<input type="email" name="email" placeholder="hunter@example.com" autocomplete="email" required />
				<button type="submit" class="q-btn q-btn-primary">Request Access</button>
			</form>
			<p class="q-form-error" id="form-error"></p>
			<small>Private. GDPR-compliant. No spam.</small>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Footer -->
	<footer class="q-foot">
		<div class="q-foot-inner">
			<div>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} · TrophyLog A/S · Denmark</div>
			<div class="q-foot-links">
				<a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
				<a href="/terms">Terms</a>
				<a href="mailto:contact@trophylog.com">Contact</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</footer>

	<!-- Sticky CTA -->
	<div class="sticky-cta" id="stickyCta">
		<span class="sticky-cta-label"><b>Join 1,400+ hunters</b> on the beta waitlist</span>
		<a href="#signup" class="sticky-cta-btn">Get Access</a>
	</div>

</Layout>

<style>
	/* ——————————————————————————————————————
	   REVEAL
	   —————————————————————————————————————— */

	.reveal {
		opacity: 0;
		transform: translateY(24px);
		transition: opacity 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
					transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
	}

	.reveal.in {
		opacity: 1;
		transform: none;
	}

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.reveal {
			transition: none;
			opacity: 1;
			transform: none;
		}
	}

	/* ——————————————————————————————————————
	   STICKY SIGNUP STRIP
	   —————————————————————————————————————— */

	.sticky-cta {
		position: fixed;
		bottom: 20px;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(20px);
		z-index: 90;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 10px;
		background: rgba(17, 25, 22, 0.85);
		backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
		border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
		border-radius: 999px;
		padding: 8px 8px 8px 20px;
		box-shadow: 0 20px 60px -20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
		opacity: 0;
		pointer-events: none;
		transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
		max-width: calc(100vw - 32px);
	}

	.sticky-cta.show {
		opacity: 1;
		pointer-events: auto;
		transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
	}

	.sticky-cta-label {
		font-size: 14px;
		color: var(--text-2);
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.sticky-cta-label b {
		color: var(--text);
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.sticky-cta-btn {
		padding: 10px 18px;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: var(--accent);
		color: var(--accent-text);
		font-size: 13px;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.02em;
		white-space: nowrap;
		transition: transform 0.15s ease, opacity 0.15s ease;
	}

	.sticky-cta-btn:hover {
		transform: translateY(-1px);
		opacity: 0.92;
	}

	@media (max-width: 560px) {
		.sticky-cta-label {
			display: none;
		}
		.sticky-cta {
			padding: 6px;
		}
	}

	/* ——————————————————————————————————————
	   NAV
	   —————————————————————————————————————— */

	.q-nav {
		position: fixed;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		z-index: 100;
		padding: 20px var(--page-pad);
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}

	.q-nav.scrolled {
		padding: 14px var(--page-pad);
		background: rgba(5, 7, 6, 0.85);
		backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
	}

	.q-nav-inner {
		max-width: var(--maxw);
		margin: 0 auto;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 24px;
	}

	.q-brand {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 10px;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 22px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--text);
	}

	.q-brand svg {
		width: 26px;
		height: auto;
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.q-nav-links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 28px;
		margin-left: 40px;
		font-size: 13px;
		letter-spacing: 0.06em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.q-nav-links a {
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
		transition: color 0.2s ease;
	}

	.q-nav-links a:hover {
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.q-nav-cta {
		margin-left: auto;
		padding: 11px 22px;
		background: var(--text);
		color: var(--bg);
		border-radius: 2px;
		font-size: 12px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
	}

	.q-nav-cta:hover {
		background: var(--accent);
		color: var(--accent-text);
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.q-nav-links {
			display: none;
		}
	}

	/* ——————————————————————————————————————
	   HERO
	   —————————————————————————————————————— */

	.q-hero {
		min-height: 100vh;
		min-height: 100dvh;
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-end;
		padding: 80px var(--page-pad);
	}

	.q-hero-bg {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		z-index: 0;
	}

	.q-hero-bg img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: center 40%;
		transform: scale(1.05);
	}

	.q-hero-overlay {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		z-index: 1;
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(5, 7, 6, 0.7) 0%, transparent 25%, transparent 55%, rgba(5, 7, 6, 0.75) 85%, rgba(5, 7, 6, 1) 100%);
	}

	.q-hero-meta {
		position: absolute;
		top: 100px;
		left: var(--page-pad);
		right: var(--page-pad);
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: 11px;
		letter-spacing: 0.18em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
		z-index: 2;
		max-width: var(--maxw);
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.q-hero-meta > div {
		display: flex;
		gap: 24px;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.q-hero-meta {
			font-size: 10px;
		}
		.q-hero-meta > div {
			gap: 12px;
		}
	}

	.q-hero-content {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 2;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: var(--maxw);
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.q-hero-num {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 13px;
		letter-spacing: 0.2em;
		color: var(--accent);
		margin-bottom: 32px;
		font-weight: 500;
		font-variation-settings: "opsz" 14;
	}

	.q-hero h1 {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-weight: 300;
		font-size: clamp(64px, 13vw, 220px);
		line-height: 0.86;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
		color: #fff;
		margin-bottom: 28px;
		font-variation-settings: "opsz" 144;
	}

	.q-hero h1 em {
		font-style: italic;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.q-hero-sub {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-style: italic;
		font-weight: 300;
		font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 34px);
		line-height: 1.3;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
		max-width: 560px;
		margin-bottom: 40px;
		font-variation-settings: "opsz" 36;
	}

	.q-ctas {
		display: flex;
		gap: 16px;
		align-items: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.q-btn {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 10px;
